# directive-no-args

## Input

```
#strict
a 1

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..12
  DIRECTIVE@0..8
    SHARP@0..1 "#"
    WORD@1..7 "strict"
    NEWLINE@7..8 "\n"
  ENTRY@8..12
    WORD_KEY@8..9
      WORD@8..9 "a"
    SPACE@9..10 " "
    INTEGER@10..11
      NUMERAL@10..11 "1"
    NEWLINE@11..12 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Directive {
            sharp: SHARP@0..1 "#",
            name: WORD@1..7 "strict",
            args: none,
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@8..9 "a",
            },
            value: Integer {
                sign: none,
                numeral: NUMERAL@10..11 "1",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

